  "title": "Perplexity AI's CEO Takes a Stand Against Nandan Nilekani's AI Strategy",
  "summary": "Aravind Srinivas, CEO of Perplexity AI, is stirring the pot with his bold challenge to Infosys Chairman Nandan Nilekani's strategy on AI development in India. While Nilekani advises a focus on AI applications, Srinivas advocates for a dual approach, urging the development of large language models in tandem with applications. Citing the success of ISRO, Srinivas believes India has the potential for technological self-reliance at a fraction of the traditional cost. This debate highlights potential paths for India to establish itself as a global leader in AI.",
